{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "987ee723ede44195989b10c1b683ad1b160969c29e19f3cc49a83b4bd09d5897", "ja": "（琴葉の新しい衣装が届いたので、さっそく試着を\nお願いした。そろそろ声を掛けても大丈夫かな……）", "zh": "（琴叶的新衣服送到了，所以马上请她试穿。现在应该差不多可以叫她了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "0fbd52213173e1bda231246d76c28ac144a15e65530ed871e5cc9980424bd6ff", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。ちょうど良かった。\n今着替え終わったんですけど、どうですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。来得正好。\n我刚换好衣服，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1002_p", "source_sha256": "99d8beb5f5535edb1390b3f04355f26a17da2fe4c590fc77f4ae8db755bf59b0", "ja": "うん、さすが琴葉だな。凛々しさの中にも、\n可憐な雰囲気があって……よく似合ってる！", "zh": "嗯，真不愧是琴叶。威风凛凛之中，\n又带有一丝楚楚可怜的气质……非常适合你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "9386c9361a1ce2cf397752e2adbaeb3844a49ae7e9c34319122670576784ad11", "ja": "本当ですか？　ありがとうございます！\nこの衣装、騎士をイメージしたデザインだそうですね。", "zh": "真的吗？谢谢您！\n听说这套服装是以骑士为灵感设计的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "98e0c1932c262f962f90d7cb423e0fa788010eb005ee727c0aa81f69a16d0bff", "ja": "けど、まさか『聖ミリオン女学園』の中で、更に\nお芝居を演じることになるとは思いませんでした。", "zh": "不过，没想到竟然会在《圣百万女学园》中，进一步出演戏剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f1d514302e3d40817becfe3bed4ee4bd32040c25ee8b1dab78c1806636664c76", "ja": "そうだな……難しい役を選んでしまって、すまない。\nでも、琴葉なら演じられるんじゃないかと思ったんだ。", "zh": "是啊……抱歉，让你选了这么难演的角色。\n不过，我觉得如果是琴叶，应该能演好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "eb06afc71e575767eda080944ff953c40a7a2dee199c6fffa980b75e5ca5489c", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとうございます！\nそう言ってもらえるのは、素直にうれしいです。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢您！\n能得到您这样的评价，我真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "e829b0cb3e813612c3ddac9b25a153878257886feffb4328ad46e7f2f8fb691e", "ja": "難しい役をいただけるのは、実力を\n認めてもらえた気持ちにもなりますし……それに。", "zh": "能接到有难度的角色，会让我觉得自己的实力得到了认可……而且。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "fae9aff9cab0ccdb33e2ee20c27854ccb574f666c0051fa9d9fd7f5452610711", "ja": "私のこと、信じて頼ってもらえているんだって。\nそう思うと、私、もっとがんばれるんです。", "zh": "一想到您相信我、愿意依靠我，我就觉得自己还能更加努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0a6379836d51be854e8816b43d6d5426297e12e1b39a017178279aa29737cd65", "ja": "琴葉……。", "zh": "琴叶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "9d4cd28c4bf22dd8545de4c2ea4cf5275d9cf3976e52f915fb67c50b322b1bec", "ja": "それに今回の撮影では、衣装に合わせて剣を用意して\nもらえるそうなので……それも、楽しみなんです。", "zh": "而且听说这次拍摄还会根据服装准备剑……我也很期待这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "b983585be49a9bded9dc197644e5259f007a074d4a57cf9720efd9e0e6d1e11d", "ja": "得意なフェンシングを活かして、騎士らしく\nカッコいいところを見せられたらな……って。", "zh": "要是能发挥我擅长的击剑，展现出\n骑士那般帅气的一面就好了……我想着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c8f31e09c11456eaf6491a0529bbe98ddbeb4d6bf03bb47f801b53774353cbd8", "ja": "ああ。劇中劇で、更に殺陣もあるとなるとな……\n琴葉にフェンシング経験があって助かったよ。", "zh": "啊。既然是剧中剧，而且还有武打戏……\n幸好琴叶有击剑经验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f7f45810972b98ea3d6dd797b37707c5a1a43ddd26e5b2e18d5c961428858e32", "ja": "くれぐれもケガには注意して、\nあとは思いっきりやってほしい！", "zh": "请务必注意不要受伤，接下来就尽情发挥吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "fcae850765e54e39d22510c8974d21f04a6654519133e3ac1f404c4622e16bbf", "ja": "はい！　私、今はアイドルが一番ですけど……\n演劇もフェンシングも、両方がんばってきたので。", "zh": "好的！我现在最重要的是偶像活动，不过……\n戏剧和击剑，我也都一直努力过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "9dcfbf25371b125b5939bcfea69d95332d6d92d3dea94cefcd188689b8a53796", "ja": "今回の役は、その成果の見せどころだと思って、\nがんばります！", "zh": "我觉得这次的角色正是展现这些成果的机会，所以我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1f21e8e15b704d7d3369f94036369889bc5282248a275e54508626c39b215f76", "ja": "ああ、頼んだぞ！　妹を助ける騎士として、\n立派に務めを果たしてほしい。", "zh": "啊，拜托你了！希望你能作为拯救妹妹的骑士，出色地完成使命。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "efbfe4d5a1c77cb60f883383fa3fe9b75650736ec118df8fc4427886b9726ce5", "ja": "もちろんです。そのために、剣を取るんですから。\n命に代えてでも、守らなくちゃ……。", "zh": "当然。正因为如此，我才要拿起剑。\n哪怕拼上性命，也必须守护……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "45e789f82c45d662b049bc9751f991b2101b974ca6b1fea9503b671f674cea1f", "ja": "大切なものを守るためだったら、私……\nどこまでもがんばれる気がするので。", "zh": "如果是为了守护重要的事物，我……\n觉得自己无论付出多大努力都能坚持下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1019_p", "source_sha256": "20f68712ef0f3b6e63a6239d2ebebdbc23442b043188b53a4525397ad3dd216f", "ja": "そうか。そういう役柄とはいえ、\nやっぱり琴葉は真面目というか……。", "zh": "这样啊。虽说只是出演那样的角色，\n但琴叶果然还是很认真啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0204_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "fd58d93ac1fcd66f431eb5888960440ac2244631d115f1cca1a1e0dc6d3c4b4a", "ja": "{$P$}……もう！\nあまり、からかわないでくださいね？", "zh": "{$P$}……真是的！别总拿我开玩笑啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
